{"nodes": [{"id": "ifit_style_guide", "label": "IFit Visual Style Guide (IFIT-Style.md)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".claude/IFIT-Style.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "style_color_palette", "label": "Color Palette Tokens", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/IFIT-Style.md", "source_location": "line 8-18", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "BackgroundPrimaryDark=#222831 (page/shell), BackgroundSecondaryDark=#393E46 (cards), TertiaryColor=#FFD369 (CTAs/highlights), TextPrimaryColorLight=#EEEEEE, TextSecondaryColorLight=#F5F5F5. Rule: never use inline hex in XAML."}, {"id": "style_typography", "label": "Typography Style Tokens (Montserrat)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/IFIT-Style.md", "source_location": "line 29-36", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "label-Title-white (Montserrat-Bold 26), label-h1-white (18), label-h2-white (16), label-h3-white (14), label-p-white (Montserrat-Medium 14), navbar-p-white (10). Spans inside FormattedString do NOT inherit FontFamily from parent Label \u2014 must always be set explicitly."}, {"id": "style_card_pattern", "label": "Card UI Patterns (Standard, Selectable, Lateral Bar, Description)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/IFIT-Style.md", "source_location": "line 55-145", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Standard card: Border StrokeThickness=0, BackgroundSecondaryDark, CornerRadius=8. Selectable: VisualStateManager Normal=BackgroundSecondaryDark, Selected=BackgroundPrimaryDark. Lateral bar (24dp, CornerRadius=8,0,8,0): semantic state indicator, always keep."}, {"id": "style_card_prohibitions", "label": "Card UI Prohibitions", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/IFIT-Style.md", "source_location": "lin